?:'General herd task')?> · <?=e(date('d M Y',strtotime($r['due_date'])))?></p></div><?php endwhile; else: ?><div class="empty">No pending reminders yet.<br><a class="link" href="reminder_add.php">Create your first reminder →</a></div><?php endif; ?><div class="record-card" style="background:#f7faf4"><h4>Good record-keeping tip</h4><p>Record the date and source of each health-service entry. HerdSignal stores the information you enter; it does not verify veterinary advice or official movement documents.</p></div></div></div>
